title: "TweetGuard — Fake Tweet Detection"
abstract: >-
  Companion implementation of the ICCIKE 2025 paper "Fake Tweets Detection
  using Bi-LSTM with GloVe Embedding": a TF-IDF + Logistic Regression baseline and a bidirectional
  LSTM with GloVe embeddings, served side by side from a Flask application.
